    "sentence_translations": [
      "Crayfish and summer nights",
      "",
      "Summer is coming and people are starting to have late-night meals.",
      "Young people enjoy sitting down on the side of the road with their friends, eating crayfish and drinking beer.",
      "If there are many people gathered, they will order several kilos of crayfish and put on plastic gloves, ..",
      ".. taking their time peeling the crayfish while drinking and chatting.",
      "Many people think crayfish is not very clean, others find it too much work.",
      "But no matter what, once people start thinking about summer nights, ..",
      ".. they will also think of red crayfish and ice cold beer.",
      ""
